Warning [jet.FloatMoney]: Binding `price` looks like money but has type `Float`
  --> tests/ui_lint/float_money_binding.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     price: half(19.98)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Floating-point money loses cents on common values like `0.1 + 0.2`
 Fix: Use `Decimal` for exact money: `price: Decimal := Decimal("9.99")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0504
